# Generated by `python -m ml_meta_perf`. The equations, tables and figures are reproducible
# from the shipped corpus in about 25 seconds, so only the narrative chapters and the
# figures the README links are tracked.
results/

# Generated by pdoc from the module docstrings; see .github/workflows/docs.yml.
docs_build/
/docs/

# Working notes, deliberately local. `CLAUDE.md` is agent orientation and `todo.md` is the
# research record -- the measured negative results, and what to record when the
# meta-dataset can be recomputed. Neither is needed to run anything, and findings that
# belong to the study go into assets/docs/ instead.
CLAUDE.md
todo.md
paired.py
paired2.py

